.SS \fBforage update\fR
walk sources and extract changed files

usage: forage update [\-h] [\-\-all] [\-\-source SOURCE_NAME] [\-\-ext EXT]
                     [\-\-orphans {list,delete,ignore}] [\-\-defer\-video]
                     [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-ocr | \-\-no\-ocr] [\-v] [\-q] [\-\-json]
                     [name]

arguments:
.RS 7
.TP
\fBname\fR
collection name (omit with \-\-all)
.RE


options:
.RS 7
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI\,SOURCE_NAME\/\fR
scope discovery + orphan sweep to one source

.TP
\fB\-\-ext\fR \fI\,EXT\/\fR
comma\-separated extensions (no dots)

.TP
\fB\-\-orphans\fR \fI\,{list,delete,ignore}\/\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-defer\-video\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-ocr\fR
force docling OCR on for this run (overrides the collection's do_ocr setting)

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-ocr\fR
force docling OCR off for this run (overrides the collection's do_ocr setting)

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR

.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
machine\-readable JSON output where applicable
.RE

